#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:5
#: 0d45286b39174a2bac0035149f17ae48
msgid "Connecting as a Support Engineer"
msgstr "以支持工程师身份连接"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:7
#: 50f02282220746debc5e2a5072a39568
msgid ""
"this page is for the use of ArduPilot support engineers. If you are a "
"Partner or user, see :ref:`support_proxy` for instructions."
msgstr "本页面供 ArduPilot 支持工程师使用。如果您是合作伙伴或用户，请参阅 :ref:`support_proxy` 中的说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:10
#: b3a63527fadb41faad855d28dedd30bc
msgid ""
"If you are a support engineer you will have been given 3 pieces of "
"information:"
msgstr "作为支持工程师，您将获得以下 3 项信息："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:13
#: a9d3d35293db4870b983ea93b3f9c8cf
msgid "the port number that you will connect on"
msgstr "您的连接端口号"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:14
#: f4cbea5f72f84909812ac5bc41db4967
msgid "the port number that your users will connect on"
msgstr "用户的连接端口号"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:15
#: 0cd575bc3c7d48bd811fcc861a42cf11
msgid "an initial randomly generated MAVLink2 signing pass phrase"
msgstr "一个初始随机生成的 MAVLink2 签名密码短语"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:19
#: 5228b2baf1ca4255b5a8fb9c36303651
msgid ""
"Your computers system clock must be accurate for the proxy to work. If it is"
" off by more than one minute then signing may fail."
msgstr "您电脑的系统时钟必须准确，代理才能正常工作。若时钟偏差超过一分钟，签名可能失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:22
#: 9e0f2acf219041adabd1dcb1214b6368
msgid ""
"To setup your support proxy port for MissionPlanner you need to use the "
"Advanced->Mavlink Signing tool:"
msgstr "要在 MissionPlanner 中设置支持代理端口，需使用「Advanced」->「Mavlink Signing」工具："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:28
#: a75064e2a4c146cd965bd7df02a6371a
msgid ""
"In that tool you need to create a signing key using the pass phrase you have"
" been given:"
msgstr "在该工具中，使用您获得的密码短语创建签名密钥："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:34
#: 23998970a4ed419c97d1f4bfcd20e014
msgid "Use the \"Add\" button to add the key, and the \"Save\" button to save it."
msgstr "使用「Add」按钮添加密钥，使用「Save」按钮保存。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:36
#: 03f285c0437848a4b630e3849447eba6
msgid ""
"Once the signing key is setup you can start to accept connections from "
"users. You should direct your users to the instructions at the top of this "
"page."
msgstr "签名密钥设置完成后，您可以开始接受用户连接。请将本页面顶部的说明提供给您的用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:40
#: 4d78121229054bac96588c0681c29106
msgid ""
"To connect to your side of the proxy use a TCP or UDPCI connection method in"
" MissionPlanner:"
msgstr "要连接到代理的您的一侧，请在 MissionPlanner 中使用 TCP 或 UDPCI 连接方式："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:46
#: 08447f2ec0414144bb5058c562157881
msgid "After pressing connect choose \"support.ardupilot.org\" as the host:"
msgstr "点击连接后，选择「support.ardupilot.org」作为主机："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:51
#: eb19abebef0d46e2b75a99ef2e398e2a
msgid "and your support engineer port number as the port:"
msgstr "并输入您的支持工程师端口号作为端口："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:57
#: ed98672272f7402b890dabeff2e75108
msgid "Managing Your Connection with the Dashboard"
msgstr "使用仪表板管理您的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:59
#: 8523d15bd6ab45fba656e6ab6c516d60
msgid ""
"The proxy has a web dashboard at `support.ardupilot.org/dashboard "
"<https://support.ardupilot.org/dashboard>`__. Log in there with your "
"**support engineer port number** and your current pass phrase."
msgstr ""
"代理在 `support.ardupilot.org/dashboard "
"<https://support.ardupilot.org/dashboard>`__ 提供了一个 Web 仪表板。请使用您的 "
"**支持工程师端口号** 和当前密码短语在此登录。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:66
#: 03455d7dc1874141a251e6751006322c
msgid "From the dashboard you can:"
msgstr "在仪表板上您可以："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:68
#: 6c984b3475b84b2ab1c9e043a1018fd1
msgid ""
"change the MAVLink2 signing pass phrase for your connection (use the "
"\"Generate\" button to get a fresh random one, or type your own, then "
"\"Save\"). This is the easiest way to rotate the pass phrase — it takes "
"effect on the proxy immediately. The Mission Planner method below still "
"works if you prefer it."
msgstr ""
"更改连接的 MAVLink2 "
"签名密码短语（点击「Generate」按钮生成一个新的随机密码短语，或自行输入，然后点击「Save」）。这是轮换密码短语最简单的方式——它会立即在代理上生效。如果您愿意，下文的"
" Mission Planner 方法仍然可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:73
#: 2411ba42261a4c10ae636616d83fc20a
msgid ""
"see which user and support-engineer connections are live right now (peer "
"addresses, byte counts, link health), and drop a stuck connection if needed"
msgstr "查看当前哪些用户连接和支持工程师连接处于活跃状态（对端地址、字节计数、链路健康状况），并可在需要时断开卡住的连接"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:76
#: f23a067562fb46c397a59d9587592494
msgid ""
"optionally record the session: tick \"record telemetry logs\" to capture a "
"MAVProxy-format ``.tlog`` of the session, and/or \"record ArduPilot bin "
"logs\" to capture the vehicle's dataflash log over MAVLink as a ``.bin`` "
"(the firmware must have the MAVLink logging backend enabled). Recorded logs "
"are listed on the dashboard and can be downloaded there; a per-connection "
"retention period controls how long they are kept."
msgstr ""
"可选地记录会话：勾选「record telemetry logs」可捕获会话的 MAVProxy 格式 ``.tlog`` 数传日志；勾选「record"
" ArduPilot bin logs」可通过 MAVLink 捕获飞行器的 dataflash 日志并保存为 ``.bin`` （固件必须启用 "
"MAVLink 日志后端）。记录的日志会列在仪表板上并可从那里下载；每个连接的保留期限控制日志保存多长时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:84
#: 4f496c8af3f84ad3bc77259c8de05e4d
msgid ""
"ArduPilot partners with admin access can additionally manage every "
"connection from the dashboard and create new partner connections (including "
"a block of consecutive IDs in one step)."
msgstr "拥有管理员权限的 ArduPilot 合作伙伴还可以在仪表板上管理所有连接，并创建新的合作伙伴连接（包括一步创建一段连续的 ID）。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:88
#: a84b541e16af4db0a2319774163429a6
msgid ""
"To change the pass phrase from Mission Planner instead, create and save a "
"new key in the MAVLink Signing tool then select it and press the \"Use\" "
"button:"
msgstr ""
"若想改用 Mission Planner 更改密码短语，请在 MAVLink Signing 工具中创建并保存新密钥，然后选择它并点击「Use」按钮："

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:95
#: 0941567a38694feabf70b5898142f371
msgid "pressing \"Use\" will update the signing key for your support ID."
msgstr "点击「Use」将更新您支持 ID 的签名密钥。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:97
#: 0d3d49f388024ad98d9bf22aca87f6ba
msgid ""
"If your stored signing timestamp gets ahead of your computer's clock (for "
"example after a clock change) signing can start failing with a replay "
"rejection. On the dashboard's edit page, tick \"reset signing timestamp\" "
"and Save to recover; if you don't have dashboard access, ask for the "
"timestamp to be reset."
msgstr ""
"如果存储的签名时间戳超前于您计算机的时钟（例如时钟变更后），签名可能会因重放拒绝而开始失败。在仪表板的编辑页面勾选「reset signing "
"timestamp」并保存即可恢复；如果您没有仪表板访问权限，请请求重置时间戳。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:103
#: aa3be86b58d64651b457e2addc9d9040
msgid ""
"For technical support please contact Andrew Tridgell on your partner support"
" channel on discord."
msgstr "如需技术支持，请通过 Discord 上的合作伙伴支持频道联系 Andrew Tridgell。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:107
#: 80aaaf15d4184839a5b62f9d06e1fc21
msgid "Useful Tips"
msgstr "实用技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:109
#: 732e26d97ab34f97b3d53a1780e7f763
msgid ""
"When helping a user with remote tuning, having them run this `LUA Applet "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/revert_param.md>`__"
" to allow you to instantly revert all tuning in case of an issue, may be "
"useful."
msgstr ""
"在协助用户进行远程调参时，让用户运行此 `LUA 应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/revert_param.md>`__"
" 可能很有用，它允许您在出现问题时立即撤销所有调参变更。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:112
#: f95152b5a3d24dcd9bcf12f155c3c4c1
msgid "Using MAVProxy as a Support Engineer"
msgstr "以支持工程师身份使用 MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:114
#: bb272c0ec31b4389adf0b711281fa320
msgid ""
"An example shell script for connecting as a support engineer using MAVProxy "
"is `available here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SupportProxy/blob/main/mav_support.sh>`__."
msgstr ""
"一个使用 MAVProxy 以支持工程师身份连接的示例 Shell 脚本 `可在此处获取 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SupportProxy/blob/main/mav_support.sh>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:118
#: b9efadcd82ea4ba1b3a9289eb747966c
msgid "DroneCAN GUI Tool"
msgstr "DroneCAN GUI 工具"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:120
#: e12272c7f6ee45c5beb025e1600b0c53
msgid ""
"Enter \"mavcan:udpout:support.ardupilot.org:\" followed by your support "
"engineer port number for the CAN interface and add your signing key."
msgstr ""
"在 CAN 接口中输入「mavcan:udpout:support.ardupilot.org:」后跟您的支持工程师端口号，并添加您的签名密钥。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:122
#: d17fc016a1b44a3bb0acc0632025a709
msgid ""
"The signing key in DroneCAN GUI Tool is the password entered into Mission "
"Planner during key generation. It is not the key that Mission Planner "
"displays."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN GUI 工具中的签名密钥是在 Mission Planner 中生成密钥时输入的密码，而非 Mission Planner "
"显示的密钥。"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:128
#: 5e11beae316c4b70bf3837d51b0c7d61
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "源代码"

#: ../../source/docs/support_proxy_supportengineer.rst:130
#: d590775cc34c4c83833c1625c2c8a741
msgid ""
"The source code for the SupportProxy tool (formerly UDPProxy) along with "
"instructions for installing it on your own machine are `available here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SupportProxy>`__."
msgstr ""
"SupportProxy 工具（前身为 UDPProxy）的源代码及在自己机器上安装的说明 `可在此处获取 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/SupportProxy>`__。"
